{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">關嘉敏日前（22日）突然在社交平台無預警宣告「結婚」，更上載了一輯與「老公」及「家人」狂歡放閃的溫馨合照，突如其來的喜訊瞬間嚇窒一眾網民！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">其實這是一場充滿童趣的烏龍「閃婚」。關嘉敏於IG分享了多張在旅遊景點拍攝的照片，只見她幾乎每一張都緊緊抱着一位可愛的捲髮小男孩。其中幾張照片，小男孩更親暱地與關嘉敏面貼面互咀，畫面超級甜蜜溫馨。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"93b8c6a9-c6f8-48e6-8c37-aa3f132e3244.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026KggI9OPyQV1790218429.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"93b8c6a9-c6f8-48e6-8c37-aa3f132e3244.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"52c46351-1451-4404-98be-8898fd3da473.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026tsXe6whb1Q1790218429.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"52c46351-1451-4404-98be-8898fd3da473.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">關嘉敏在帖文中幽默地交代這段「戀情」的神速發展：「我結婚了！第一日問我可唔可以做女朋友，第二日叫我老婆，然後順便渡蜜月旅行。一星期完成咗一半嘅人生。而佢只係得五歲😂😂😂😂！成就解鎖，第一次擁有五歲嘅老公！#佢都係我童公喎」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1587a1d9-ed50-4b2b-b0c0-63278919eeff.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026sxbwQB4fWL1790218428.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1587a1d9-ed50-4b2b-b0c0-63278919eeff.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這則搞笑的帖文曝光後，即時引來大批圈中好友及網民留言洗版。不少人笑指被起步的震撼宣言騙倒：「真係被標題嚇一嚇」，亦有大批網民激讚這位「童公」相當叻仔：「5歲老公好識揀，娶到女神」、「童公好有眼光」、「甜過好多真情侶！」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T03:38:30.407663+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":389,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}